Ryuji Harada-san.

00:10:13.221 --> 00:10:14.681
Oh, Ryuji Harada-san.

00:10:14.821 --> 00:10:15.421
Ryuji Harada-san.

00:10:15.421 --> 00:10:16.081
That's impressive.

00:10:16.081 --> 00:10:17.081
