00:10:53.446 --> 00:10:54.986
You're serious now.

00:10:54.986 --> 00:10:55.986
Three hours.

00:10:56.066 --> 00:10:57.926
Okamura-san.
Okamura-san, three hours.

00:10:58.966 --> 00:10:59.506
Okamura-san, three hours.

00:10:59.506 --> 00:11:00.147
Enough already.

00:11:00.147 --> 00:11:00.927
Okamura-san, three hours.

00:11:00.927 --> 00:11:02.147
How many minutes is that?

00:11:02.173 --> 00:11:03.887
But Okamura-san is a really nice person,
isn't he?

00:11:03.887 --> 00:11:05.227
That's long. Really long.

00:11:05.727 --> 00:11:06.387
It is long.

00:11:06.387 --> 00:11:07.848
