00:11:49.093 --> 00:11:50.093
Like, 'What is this?'

00:11:51.203 --> 00:11:52.345
'What is this? I don't know you.'

00:11:53.874 --> 00:11:54.955
Maybe like a correction committee.

00:11:55.135 --> 00:11:56.135
Oh.

00:11:56.499 --> 00:11:57.571
