Whoa! Whoa!

00:13:48.168 --> 00:13:49.068
Let's stop.
Stop, stop.

00:13:49.068 --> 00:13:50.289
That's crazy.

00:13:50.519 --> 00:13:51.519
Let's stop for a second.

00:13:51.519 --> 00:13:52.289
That was crazy.

