00:16:15.220 --> 00:16:16.120
Like this.

00:16:16.120 --> 00:16:17.400
Do the one you're good at.

00:16:17.810 --> 00:16:18.810
No, before that.

00:16:18.810 --> 00:16:19.401
Tetsuya Takeda.

00:16:19.401 --> 00:16:20.921
This is scary now.

00:16:21.141 --> 00:16:23.401
Someone should call him in.

00:16:23.401 --> 00:16:23.921
Takeda-san.

00:16:23.921 --> 00:16:24.921
Just a little, yeah.

00:16:24.921 --> 00:16:25.462
Takeda-san.

00:16:25.462 --> 00:16:29.383
Takeda-san.

00:16:29.583 --> 00:16:30.163
Turkey.

00:16:30.163 --> 00:16:31.323
Turkey, turkey, turkey.

