But if that was it, it should have moved
already.

00:17:01.970 --> 00:17:02.631
If so.

00:17:02.631 --> 00:17:04.931
Maybe we can't keep doing the same
impression.

00:17:05.112 --> 00:17:06.792
Oh, maybe.

00:17:06.792 --> 00:17:08.333
That kind of rule?

00:17:08.333 --> 00:17:09.293
