00:17:38.845 --> 00:17:39.845
Oh, I see.

00:17:39.915 --> 00:17:41.486
So there is some rule besides the
ten-minute one.

00:17:41.486 --> 00:17:43.427
Yes, that's what I'm saying.

00:17:43.427 --> 00:17:44.087
I see.

00:17:44.087 --> 00:17:45.167
That has to be it.

00:17:45.167 --> 00:17:47.508
Huh?
Huh? What?

00:17:47.508 --> 00:17:51.630
Huh? Huh? Huh? Huh?

00:17:51.990 --> 00:17:52.990
Scary, scary, scary.

00:17:52.991 --> 00:17:54.011
W-w-wait a second.

00:17:54.011 --> 00:17:55.331
That's what I'm saying.

00:17:58.392 --> 00:18:00.113
There's a rule within the ten minutes.

00:18:00.113 --> 00:18:01.553
You can't bomb.

00:18:01.553 --> 00:18:02.773
That's what I'm saying.

00:18:02.773 --> 00:18:03.513
Kansai dialect?

00:18:03.513 --> 00:18:04.453
