00:18:05.214 --> 00:18:06.214
Emotion?

00:18:06.234 --> 00:18:07.194
Maybe we can't get angry.

00:18:07.194 --> 00:18:08.534
Like, 'What are you talking about?'

00:18:08.714 --> 00:18:12.615
A comeback carries a bit of anger. That's
what tsukkomi is.

00:18:12.715 --> 00:18:14.235
Kansai-style tsukkomi sounds a little
angry.

00:18:14.245 --> 00:18:15.245
Kansai tsukkomi?

00:18:15.245 --> 00:18:15.956
Is that it?

00:18:15.956 --> 00:18:18.136
