00:18:18.136 --> 00:18:19.476
Fujimoto, use standard Japanese.

00:18:19.476 --> 00:18:21.297
In standard Japanese.
Fujimoto-san, standard Japanese.

00:18:21.297 --> 00:18:22.297
Standard Japanese.

00:18:22.297 --> 00:18:22.937
Try standard Japanese.

00:18:22.937 --> 00:18:24.277
Everything after Fujimoto-san.

00:18:24.357 --> 00:18:25.177
Right.

00:18:25.177 --> 00:18:26.658
Okay then, Fujimoto-san.

00:18:26.678 --> 00:18:29.058
Should someone set up a joke?

00:18:29.678 --> 00:18:31.158
Make a joke.
Okay.

00:18:31.619 --> 00:18:36.119
Mother, let us remove your shoulder.

00:18:36.399 --> 00:18:37.880
What would removing it do?

00:18:40.560 --> 00:18:41.560
Oh, it's fine.

00:18:41.560 --> 00:18:42.120
It's fine.

00:18:42.120 --> 00:18:43.121
See? Standard Japanese.

00:18:43.121 --> 00:18:44.921
Standard-Japanese tsukkomi is okay.

00:18:44.921 --> 00:18:47.622
So that's it.

00:18:47.722 --> 00:18:49.842
