It does get you motivated.

00:53:59.408 --> 00:54:00.308
Actually, drinking water...

00:54:00.308 --> 00:54:01.048
I'm fired up now.

00:54:01.048 --> 00:54:01.928
I can go for hours.

00:54:01.928 --> 00:54:03.428
Let's clear this, all of us.

00:54:03.448 --> 00:54:06.289
These are two hours you can't experience
unless you're in this world.

00:54:06.289 --> 00:54:07.289
Right.

00:54:07.329 --> 00:54:08.329
If anything, thank you.

00:54:08.329 --> 00:54:09.389
Thank you.

00:54:09.669 --> 00:54:11.329
For letting us have this experience.

00:54:11.329 --> 00:54:12.229
This is fun.

00:54:12.229 --> 00:54:15.269
When we get out, we'll all be bigger
people.

00:54:15.709 --> 00:54:17.369
That's right.
Oh! See!

00:54:17.369 --> 00:54:18.369
See, we can sit now.

00:54:18.470 --> 00:54:19.330
We can sit.

00:54:19.330 --> 00:54:20.270
See, it changed again.

00:54:20.270 --> 00:54:21.210
Don't underestimate us.

00:54:21.210 --> 00:54:22.830
All right, we'll do this.

00:54:23.410 --> 00:54:24.970
Don't underestimate us.

00:54:24.990 --> 00:54:27.310
Don't underestimate us.
Oh! Oh!

00:54:27.310 --> 00:54:28.430
Fujimoto-san, we can finally sit.

00:54:28.970 --> 00:54:29.970
No, no, no.

00:54:29.970 --> 00:54:30.770
It was cramped.

00:54:30.770 --> 00:54:32.531
I want you to see that as proof of
motivation.

00:54:32.751 --> 00:54:33.751
Oh, that kind of thing.

00:54:33.931 --> 00:54:35.131
How many times have I helped people?

00:54:35.131 --> 00:54:37.491
Right? Want me to help you?

00:54:37.971 --> 00:54:38.971
Mountains of... wristwatches.

00:54:40.131 --> 00:54:41.131
No, that's different. Wait.

00:54:41.131 --> 00:54:42.131
Was that Hidetoshi Nakata?

00:54:42.651 --> 00:54:44.292
It's so hot, I'm getting stupid.

00:54:44.852 --> 00:54:46.052
The heat is the worst part.

00:54:46.052 --> 00:54:46.572
It is hot.

00:54:46.572 --> 00:54:50.052
It is hot.

00:54:50.592 --> 00:54:51.592
Oh.

00:54:52.332 --> 00:54:57.513
At this point, kisses might get them
through it.

00:54:57.603 --> 00:54:58.603
Well, I see.

00:54:58.613 --> 00:55:01.533
But we still have half left, so let's see
what happens.

00:55:03.094 --> 00:55:09.894
Now then, we have two guests here who
experienced this.

00:55:11.201 --> 00:55:12.415
Let's have them come in.

00:55:12.415 --> 00:55:13.175
Come on in.

00:55:13.175 --> 00:55:14.395
Thank you.

00:55:14.635 --> 00:55:15.755
Good work.

00:55:15.935 --> 00:55:18.256
Good work.
Oh, you're late.

00:55:18.256 --> 00:55:18.856
So irresponsible.

00:55:18.856 --> 00:55:19.856
No.

00:55:20.336 --> 00:55:21.336
Who's irresponsible?

00:55:21.816 --> 00:55:23.536
Please stop.

00:55:23.556 --> 00:55:24.376
Don't say that.

00:55:24.376 --> 00:55:25.516
You were waiting, weren't you?

00:55:26.957 --> 00:55:27.957
Thanks for having us.

00:55:28.137 --> 00:55:30.697
From what we saw, there's still half left,

00:55:31.737 --> 00:55:35.518
but it does look like kisses can get you
pretty far.

00:55:35.918 --> 00:55:40.078
But the kisses probably have to be truly
heartfelt. If you fire them off too easily,

00:55:40.629 --> 00:55:41.987
they stop working partway through.

00:55:42.088 --> 00:55:43.088
Right, right.

00:55:43.159 --> 00:55:45.999
Kisses gradually become routine too.

00:55:45.999 --> 00:55:46.519
That's true.

00:55:46.519 --> 00:55:49.519
For us, the first kiss was a real kiss.

00:55:49.799 --> 00:55:50.740
What are you talking about?

00:55:50.740 --> 00:55:53.880
Well, it's true. We're close as partners.

00:55:53.960 --> 00:55:56.440
Please kiss Fujimoto-san once.

00:55:56.580 --> 00:55:57.580
He's incredibly good at it.

00:55:57.580 --> 00:55:58.501
No, enough already.

00:55:58.501 --> 00:55:59.341
True.

00:55:59.341 --> 00:56:00.921
I got seriously turned on,

00:56:01.741 --> 00:56:03.861
and wondered why Yukina would run away
from this.

00:56:04.041 --> 00:56:04.841
Wow.

00:56:04.841 --> 00:56:05.841
Seriously.

00:56:06.221 --> 00:56:14.002
It was so good, I thought, if anything,
that's why she married him.

00:56:14.122 --> 00:56:17.583
It was insane.
